<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-MASHONALAND 279-9 V ENGLAND (197) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MASHONALAND 279-9 V ENGLAND (197) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mashonaland, replying to England's</p>
<p>first innings 197, were 279 for nine at the close on the second</p>
<p>day of the four-day match at the Harare Sports Club on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 197 (R.Croft 80 not out; J.Kirtley 5-53),</p>
<p>Mashonoland 279-9 (D.Houghton 110, A.Campbell 55; P.Tufnell</p>
<p>4-77, R.Croft 4-65).</p>
